// LaTeX commands inside formulas: sizes, stacks, styles and classes.
notation tex

Sizes: $\bigl( x \bigr)$, $\Bigl[ \frac{a}{b} \Bigr]$, $\left\{ x \;\middle|\; x > 0 \right\}$, $(x^2)$.

Stacks: $\overset{\text{def}}{=}$, $a \stackrel{?}{=} b$, $\underset{n \to \infty}{\lim}$,
$\underline{x + y}$, $\overbrace{a + b}^{2}$, $\underbrace{x_1 + \dots + x_n}_{n}$,
$A \xrightarrow{f} B \xleftarrow[g]{h} C$, $\overrightarrow{AB}$.

Styles: $\dfrac{1}{2}$, $\tfrac{1}{2}$, $\displaystyle\sum_{i=1}^{n} a_i$, $\sum\limits_{i} a_i$, $\int\nolimits_0^1 f$.

Classes: $a \mathrel{\#} b$, $\mathop{\mathrm{ess\,sup}}_{x} f$, $a \mathbin{\circ} b$.

Arguments: $\hat{x}^2$, $\bar{x}_i$, $f^{(n)}(x)$, $x_{(k)}$, $a+-b$.
